    {
      "id": "1400a8993f43431b9052f6cb3c3f1d4a3c14fd6f",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1710219752,
          "type": null,
          "body": "> IEEE 802.1Q 21.5.3.2 If the Chassis ID Length field is 0, then the Chassis ID Subtype is not present.\n\nTrue. But then Table 21-7 — Sender ID TLV format.\n\n| Field | Octet |\n|-------|-------|\n| Chassis ID Length | 4 |\n| Chassis ID Subtype | 5 |\n| Chassis ID | 6 — (Chassid ID Length - 5) |\n| Management Address Domain Length | (Chassis ID Length + 6) |\n\nSo iff Chassis ID Length = 0 (no Chassis ID is specified) the Management Address Domain Length is at octet 6, leaving octet 5 undefined...",
          "author": {
            "id": 2398962,
            "username": "JaapKeuter",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Jaap Keuter",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/722b0c520542a23cb8f8ea7070a45c88f9e9214dc700ac151e419e9649e0304e?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/JaapKeuter"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-12-30T16:00:40.843Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-12-30T16:00:40.843Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 272686823,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 13816,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "43307d8dba19d82135d942287e7dcb40fc9a0242",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1710221576,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Ah, good point. \"Not present\" still means an octet is there, just undefined. So the right handling is a little bit different, to skip that octet if the length is zero.\n\nI will fix it.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
          },
          "created_at": "2023-12-30T16:11:43.294Z",
          "updated_at": "2023-12-30T16:11:43.294Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 272686823,
          "noteable_type": "MergeRequest",
          "project_id": 7898047,
          "resolvable": false,
          "confidential": false,
          "internal": false,
          "imported": false,
          "imported_from": "none",
          "noteable_iid": 13816,
          "commands_changes": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a48749793a3a30abcbe76d2c980d44cbe04c031d",
      "individual_note": true,
      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1710221974,
          "type": null,
          "body": "OTOH I'm confused by the statement below Table 21-7:\n\"Validation Test: The Length field is large enough to contain all of the fields indicated as being present by the Chassis ID Length, Management Address Domain Length, and/or Management Address Length fields.\"\n\nWhich implies that fields that are not present *don't* have unassigned octets, as they're not included in the Length field (and it would be strange to not include them in the length field but have unassigned octets.)\n\nI think the spec is a bit contradictory.",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/99c30adacedf45514aaf711ba8a44f56322ebb53e9b550b7e3c9cd83bd6a1408?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/johnthacker"
